        "description": "MUTATING operation. Verify target and authorized intent; reconcile outcome before retry. Deletes a follow-up status by id (hard delete).\n\nThis is a v2 native-entity endpoint served from the `/v2/api/entity` base and authenticated with a Bearer token. **Note the `/delete/` segment** — the delete verb lives at `/delete/follow_up_status/{id}`; sending `DELETE` to `/follow_up_status/{id}` returns `405`.",
